<section>
    <h2>Design Philosophy</h2>

    <p>unit.gl is built on several key principles:</p>

    <ul>
        <li>
            <div class="list-item">
                <span class="list-item__title">Mathematical Harmony</span>
                <span class="list-item__meta">Use ratios and scales to create naturally pleasing proportions</span>
            </div>
        </li>
        <li>
            <div class="list-item">
                <span class="list-item__title">Consistency Over Convenience</span>
                <span class="list-item__meta">Constrained values prevent arbitrary choices</span>
            </div>
        </li>
        <li>
            <div class="list-item">
                <span class="list-item__title">Accessibility First</span>
                <span class="list-item__meta">REM-based units respect user preferences</span>
            </div>
        </li>
        <li>
            <div class="list-item">
                <span class="list-item__title">Composable Architecture</span>
                <span class="list-item__meta">Mix functions, mixins, and utilities as needed</span>
            </div>
        </li>
    </ul>
</section>
